version 3.03

Format 1024 768 1.0
PixelSamples 4 4
PixelFilter "gaussian" 2.0 2.0
ShadingRate 1.0
Display "10_blobby_lava_lamp_metaballs.tif" "file" "rgba"

Projection "perspective" "fov" [38.0]
Clipping 0.1 100.0

Translate 0.0 -0.1 7.0
Rotate -14.0 1 0 0

WorldBegin

